{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a1-explainer-about-soft-drinks/audio/main-74e2e9e7647f.mp3","durationSec":128.64,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.16,"text":"A soft drink is a cold drink with bubbles."},{"start":2.94,"end":5.32,"text":"The bubbles come from a gas called carbon dioxide."},{"start":6.22,"end":7.84,"text":"This gas makes the drink fizzy."},{"start":8.78,"end":11.16,"text":"Most soft drinks also have sugar and water."},{"start":11.16,"end":15.68,"text":"Coca-Cola, for example, has water, sugar, and a special mix of flavors."},{"start":16.5,"end":19.02,"text":"It was made in Atlanta, USA, in 1886."},{"start":20.06,"end":24.62,"text":"Today, people drink about 1.9 billion servings of Coca-Cola every day."},{"start":25.56,"end":28.42,"text":"Two of the biggest soft drink brands are Coca-Cola and Pepsi."},{"start":28.42,"end":30.58,"text":"Coca-Cola started in the USA."},{"start":31.42,"end":34.1,"text":"Pepsi also started in the USA, in 1893."},{"start":34.9,"end":38.16,"text":"Both drinks are cola — dark, sweet, and fizzy."},{"start":39.28,"end":42.58,"text":"Today, you can buy Coca-Cola in more than 200 countries."},{"start":43.3,"end":45.9,"text":"Pepsi is sold in more than 200 countries too."},{"start":46.58,"end":50.68,"text":"These brands spend billions of dollars on advertising every year."},{"start":51.36,"end":53.74,"text":"Most soft drinks have a lot of sugar."},{"start":53.74,"end":57.78,"text":"One can of regular Coca-Cola has about 39 grams of sugar."},{"start":58.52,"end":60.2,"text":"That is about 10 teaspoons."},{"start":60.2,"end":64.06,"text":"Doctors say too much sugar is not good for your health."},{"start":64.62,"end":68.14,"text":"Because of this, many companies now make drinks with less sugar."},{"start":68.92,"end":70.88,"text":"Diet Coke, for example, has no sugar."},{"start":71.68,"end":77.08,"text":"In 2023, sales of low-sugar drinks grew faster than regular soft drinks in many countries."},{"start":78.06,"end":80.14,"text":"Soft drink companies always try new flavors."},{"start":80.86,"end":86.02,"text":"In 2023, Coca-Cola released a special flavor called Coca-Cola Starlight."},{"start":86.7,"end":88.66,"text":"It was only available for a short time."},{"start":89.46,"end":93.34,"text":"Pepsi also makes many different flavors, like Pepsi Mango and Pepsi Lime."},{"start":94.04,"end":97.98,"text":"In Japan, Fanta makes unusual flavors like melon and grape."},{"start":98.7,"end":102.16,"text":"New flavors help companies attract young people and stay popular."},{"start":102.96,"end":105.18,"text":"Soft drinks come in cans and plastic bottles."},{"start":105.96,"end":107.9,"text":"These can create a lot of waste."},{"start":108.31,"end":112.22,"text":"Many countries now ask people to recycle cans and bottles."},{"start":112.22,"end":119.34,"text":"Coca-Cola said in 2022 that it wants all its packaging to be recyclable by 2025."},{"start":119.34,"end":123.14,"text":"Plastic bottles are a big problem for the ocean."},{"start":124.4,"end":128.06,"text":"Some companies now use recycled plastic to make new bottles."}],"words":[{"text":"A","start":0,"end":0.16},{"text":"soft","start":0.16,"end":0.52},{"text":"drink","start":0.52,"end":0.8},{"text":"is","start":0.8,"end":0.98},{"text":"a","start":0.98,"end":1.12},{"text":"cold","start":1.12,"end":1.34},{"text":"drink","start":1.34,"end":1.56},{"text":"with","start":1.56,"end":1.8},{"text":"bubbles","start":1.8,"end":2.16},{"text":"The","start":2.94,"end":2.96},{"text":"bubbles","start":2.96,"end":3.24},{"text":"come","start":3.24,"end":3.5},{"text":"from","start":3.5,"end":3.68},{"text":"a","start":3.68,"end":3.8},{"text":"gas","start":3.8,"end":4.1},{"text":"called","start":4.1,"end":4.36},{"text":"carbon","start":4.36,"end":4.78},{"text":"dioxide","start":4.78,"end":5.32},{"text":"This","start":6.22,"end":6.38},{"text":"gas","start":6.38,"end":6.68},{"text":"makes","start":6.68,"end":7},{"text":"the","start":7